{
  "description": "GET /openapi/v1/{omadacId}/sites/{siteId}/ap-groups entries (ApGroupOpenApiVO, docs/omada-openapi-ops.md) for validateOpenApiApGroup(), and a `result` page served to OpenApiClient.listApGroups().",
  "valid": [
